      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `f6f437d3096b939951fc6774015bf59120b651989ee1c7184be1f24957603f62--criminal-courts-2021-22-cube-5-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 57a801b6b348af71b2037f695270ce24feac91e37172d53d00bbe1c5b9c0ed22 | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | 8ed0cea731524bd8f61507fb5f28daaa65b26e8d6ffcd49e4a2a3c58e6a5933b | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | b7bde823cd1c338ebceb070d772354fe48aad2dafab7815ec9bb034e36473e54 | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | f3c0f6f7500578d5f07be3742955cd730f8f5e41f8f995df44113f9737d8b138 | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | 3f3feac7262774aa823ce0d259eb87c91201361dfea94f70e30ce1c80edc3c46 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | 7500a510a302222d7094ed585d9d6df93854c580d1bcf77422f13f101bbb63c1 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (66d08259bf923e434cc4773ee8d314931fff1ff7b963018c6bd764918fd59b55). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
